  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Date: 2006-09-01 17:02",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "See initial proposal:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.cs.cornell.edu/payette/fedora/designs/cmda/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.cs.cornell.edu/payette/fedora/designs/cmda/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-11-16 10:13",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Look at ways to re-architect the Fedora disseminator",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "architecture so that it is less rigid and easier to manage.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "We need a way that it is easy to modify a bdef/bmech and to",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "not have to modify every subscribing object when a",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "disseminator change must be made.  The proposal is a looser",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "binding of the disseminators by having content model objects",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "that have disseminators on them.  Then, data objects can",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "have a late binding of disseminators based on whether they",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(1) have the same content model (via content model",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "identifier) or (2) have a relationship to a content model",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "object in RELS-EXT.  ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Look at ways to extend the existing dissemination service to",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "support this.  Another possibility is to implement this in",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "the manner that the default disseminator is implemented in",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "the \"dynamic behavior\" section of the code.   Maybe in",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "addition to the default disseminator there can be another",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "thing plugged that can figure out if there is a late-bind",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "disseminator for an object.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
